description: API backend conventions for Vercel serverless api/index.ts
globs: api/**/*.ts,shared/api.ts,swagger.yaml
alwaysApply: false
---

# API / backend

- All route handlers live in `api/index.ts` (serverless monolith — do not runtime-import sibling `api/*.ts`)
- Shared types: `import type { ... } from "../shared/api"` only
- Do **not** `import` runtime modules from `../shared/` or `../lib/` (breaks Vercel → ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND)
- Keep inlined logic in sync with `shared/`; gate: `npm run check:api-inline` (also in `deploy:prod`)
- Update `swagger.yaml` when endpoints change
- Dev: single port **8080** for frontend + backend (`createServer()` exported for Vitest)
- HTTP coverage: add `api/**/*.integration.test.ts` or `api/**/*.test.ts` using supertest + `api/testHelpers.ts`
- Only add endpoints when needed (secrets, DB, server-only logic)
